    "body": "Cannot start #2617 because its required CPU evaluator from #2613 is absent.\n\nOn upstream/main e042e32f8, `crates/geometry/src/nesting.rs` exports only `raster`.\nThe raster module provides grid types and conservative rasterization. It has no candidate search or evaluator seam.\n\n#2613 remains open. No open PR provides that dependency, so there is no PR to stack on.\nThe overlap checks found no open PR for `nesting.rs`, `nesting/raster.rs`, or `tests/nesting_raster.rs`.\n\nI made no claim and changed no project files. No tests ran. Adding the CPU search would also implement #2613, outside this assignment.\n",
